,"textMapHash":3921443210,"text":"キャサリン、新しい依頼があるって聞いたんだけど、本当か？","nextNodeIds":[400540102]},{"nodeId":400540102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3004,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":3834186130,"text":"はい。ただいま入っているお仕事ですが、依頼人はあなた方をご指名です。","nextNodeIds":[400540103]},{"nodeId":400540103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1969957450,"text":"「指名」？なんだか緊張するな…どんな仕事なんだ？","nextNodeIds":[400540104]},{"nodeId":400540104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3004,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":136083970,"text":"ふふ、ご安心ください、危険な仕事ではございません。お二人もご存じかと思いますが、もうすぐ稲妻では「光華容{RUBY#[S]こうかすがたのいろどりさい}彩祭」という盛大な祭典が開かれようとしています。","nextNodeIds":[400540105]},{"nodeId":400540105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2207086922,"text":"おお！お祭り！そういえばオイラたち、まだ稲妻のお祭りには参加したことがなかったな。","nextNodeIds":[400540106]},{"nodeId":400540106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3004,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":2708076274,"text":"この祭典は、社奉行と八重神子様によって取り仕切られています。そして今回あなた方に依頼なさったのも、他でもない八重様なのです。","nextNodeIds":[400540107]},{"nodeId":400540107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4285394274,"text":"依頼人は神子だったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[400540108]},{"nodeId":400540108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3134581866,"text":"えへへ、神子はへんてこりんなアイデアをたくさん持ってるから、きっと面白い祭りになるだろうな。","nextNodeIds":[400540109]},{"nodeId":400540109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1748482650,"text":"鳴神大社に行って、どんな依頼か確認してこようぜ。","nextNodeIds":[400540110]},{"nodeId":400540110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3004,"speakerName":"キャサリン","textMapHash":518639442,"text":"それほど遠くまで行く必要はありません。八重様なら今、花見坂の八重堂にいらっしゃいます。あなた方をご案内するよう言伝を頼まれていたんです。","nextNodeIds":[400540111]},{"nodeId":400540111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2345013922,"text":"そうだったのか、じゃあ早速行こうぜ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4005401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3004"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4005402,"order":2,"stepDescription":"八重堂に行って八重神子を探す","stepDescTextMapHash":2893151436,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4005402,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1034"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[4005402],"talks":[{"talkId":4005402,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","beginCond":[{"param":["4005402","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":4005402,"initDialog":400540201,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1034],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/EQ/RongCaiJi_40054/Q4005402","priority":5,"questId":40054,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":400540201,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":245851530,"text":"荒谷、黒田、そちらの状況はどうじゃ？","nextNodeIds":[400540202]},{"nodeId":400540202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3030,"speakerName":"荒谷","textMapHash":782630114,"text":"ご報告いたします。八重堂の書籍、並びに個人の委託による印刷物、すべて昨日の午後に製本と発送を完了いたしました。","nextNodeIds":[400540203]},{"nodeId":400540203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3020103930,"text":"うむ、悪くない。村田の方はどうなっておる？","nextNodeIds":[400540204]},{"nodeId":400540204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3190,"speakerName":"村田","textMapHash":660872826,"text":"天井屋とセーリングブリーズから連絡があった、『雷電将軍に転生したら、天下無敵になった』と『お願いっ！私の仙狐宮司』の関連資料についてもすでに準備が整っております！","nextNodeIds":[400540205]},{"nodeId":400540205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1365246962,"text":"よかろう。小野寺はどうじゃ？","nextNodeIds":[400540206]},{"nodeId":400540206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30139,"speakerName":"小野寺","textMapHash":328514186,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[400540207]},{"nodeId":400540207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2736613298,"text":"小—野—寺—","nextNodeIds":[400540208]},{"nodeId":400540208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30139,"speakerName":"小野寺","textMapHash":3646867210,"text":"あっ、は、はい…ご報告いたします…！新刊即売会の準備はすべて予定通り進行中です！","nextNodeIds":[400540209]},{"nodeId":400540209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":4274771538,"text":"小野寺、此度の即売会の企画は汝が立てたもの。言い換えれば汝は妾たちの「大将」なんじゃ。もっと自信を持たんか。","nextNodeIds":[400540210]},{"nodeId":400540210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1642581234,"text":"心配せずとも、この企画は必ず成功する。妾のお墨付きじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[400540211]},{"nodeId":400540211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2224912538,"text":"そうじゃな…特別に二日間の休暇をやろう。この機にしっかりと休むがよい。即売会当日は忙しくなるからの。","nextNodeIds":[400540212]},{"nodeId":400540212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30139,"speakerName":"小野寺","textMapHash":948033802,"text":"八重様…ありがとうございます…！","nextNodeIds":[400540213]},{"nodeId":400540213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3607867186,"text":"さて、皆やるべきことがいっぱいじゃ。時間は待ってはくれぬぞ、すぐに取りかかるがよい。解散！","nextNodeIds":[400540215]},{"nodeId":400540215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1272457674,"text":"元気にしておったか、童たち。その様子じゃと、すでに妾の依頼を引き受けたようじゃな？","nextNodeIds":[400540216]},{"nodeId":400540216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1222328290,"text":"おいおい神子、もうすぐ祭りだってのに、鳴神大社に戻らなくていいのか？こんなところで、娯楽小説にかかりっきりで…","nextNodeIds":[400540217]},{"nodeId":400540217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4285083162,"text":"あっ、オイラたちを呼んだのって、もしかして祭りの準備を丸投げするためなのか…？ふんっ！そんな依頼、引き受けてやらないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[400540218]},{"nodeId":400540218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1393220202,"text":"そうだそうだ、引き受けない！","nextNodeIds":[400540219]},{"nodeId":400540219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":310314314,"text":"シクシク、なんと嘆かわしいことか。妾は祭りのためにこれだけ苦労をしておるというのに、まるでサボっておるかのようなその言い草…","nextNodeIds":[400540220]},{"nodeId":400540220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3656510186,"text":"童よ、祭りが鳴神大社と関係しているなどと、いったい誰が言ったのじゃ？","nextNodeIds":[400540221]},{"nodeId":400540221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1063826314,"text":"えっ、そうじゃないのか？だってここは稲妻だろ。","nextNodeIds":[400540222]},{"nodeId":400540222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":4255077210,"text":"確かにそうじゃの。じゃが、鎖国令が解かれた今の稲妻は、もう昔のような不変を渇望する国ではなくなった。","nextNodeIds":[400540223]},{"nodeId":400540223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3499272194,"text":"それゆえ、従来の仕来たりに基づいた伝統的な祭りではなく、一味違ったものにしようと、社奉行と共に決めたんじゃ。稲妻の風格を保ちつつ、国際的な文化振興の会を開くつもりでおる。","nextNodeIds":[400540224,400540225]},{"nodeId":400540224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":518788234,"text":"国際的な…","nextNodeIds":[400540226]},{"nodeId":400540226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3664017834,"text":"ふふっ、どうやら容彩祭の由緒から説明しなければならぬようじゃの。","nextNodeIds":[400540227]},{"nodeId":400540227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":4204903346,"text":"伝説によると、古代の稲妻には、かつて詩歌の達者な五人の歌人がいたそうじゃ。人々は彼らを「五歌仙」と呼んでおった。","nextNodeIds":[400540228]},{"nodeId":400540228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3621673770,"text":"毎年、彼らは五歌仙の中から一人を派遣して、五人で作って編纂した歌集を将軍に献上しておったんじゃ。このことは当時の人々の間でも雅な話じゃと語り継がれておった。","nextNodeIds":[400540229]},{"nodeId":400540229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3435063138,"text":"彼らのおかげで、稲妻の文化も、当時はとても栄えていたんじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[400540230]},{"nodeId":400540230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1550035322,"text":"後に人々は彼らを題材に、様々な様式で五歌仙の物語を作った。その物語から「容彩祭」が生まれ、創作が生活にもたらす喜びを祝うようになったんじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[400540231]},{"nodeId":400540231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4147250370,"text":"やっぱり文化的な色がすごく濃いお祭りだったんだな。","nextNodeIds":[400540232]},{"nodeId":400540232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1340401754,"text":"うむ。古い言葉で言うなら「風雅」というものじゃな。しかし残念ながら、時が経つにつれ、五歌仙もこの祭りも人々の記憶から消し去られていった。","nextNodeIds":[400540233]},{"nodeId":400540233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3490308634,"text":"じゃから今回は、容彩祭の復興に向けて——","nextNodeIds":[400540234]},{"nodeId":400540234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2988397234,"text":"娯楽小説の創作を中心とした文化交流展を開く！","nextNodeIds":[400540235]},{"nodeId":400540235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1398896482,"text":"えっ、ちょっと待て…娯楽小説！？","nextNodeIds":[400540236]},{"nodeId":400540236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2225608738,"text":"「風雅」はどこに行ったの？","nextNodeIds":[400540237]},{"nodeId":400540237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2677120018,"text":"そんな、信じられぬというような目で見るでない。古く、詩歌は流行の媒体じゃった。その流行は今や、「娯楽小説」となっておる。ただそれだけのことじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[400540238]},{"nodeId":400540238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1746710842,"text":"重要なのは形式ではなく、「創作」であることなんじゃ。過去ばかりを気にして形式や内容に拘っていては良い作品も生み出されぬ。","nextNodeIds":[400540239]},{"nodeId":400540239,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2255789138,"text":"それに、「今を大切にする」という観念は、今の稲妻にぴったりじゃと思わぬか？","nextNodeIds":[400540240]},{"nodeId":400540240,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2598197474,"text":"これを機に、娯楽小説を通してテイワットに稲妻を再認識してもらうこともできて、一石二鳥じゃ。","nextNodeIds":[400540241,400540242]},{"nodeId":400540241,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3255414434,"text":"これが俗に言う…","nextNodeIds":[400540243]},{"nodeId":400540243,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3504178634,"text":"うわ、危なかったぞ…おまえが注意してくれなかったら、オイラも神子に騙されてたところだ！","nextNodeIds":[400540244]},{"nodeId":400540244,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1071731866,"text":"ふんっ、オイラたちを騙そうたってそうはいかないぞ！おまえのことだから、どうせ個人的な趣味で決めたんだろ！","nextNodeIds":[400540245]},{"nodeId":400540245,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3639658074,"text":"ふふっ、妾の趣味でもあることは否定せんがの。じゃが、小説でも祭りでも、新たな着想で大衆の興味を引く必要がある。","nextNodeIds":[400540246]},{"nodeId":400540246,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3993336082,"text":"どうじゃ、容彩祭でどんな面白いものが見られるのか…汝らは気にならぬのか？","nextNodeIds":[400540247]},{"nodeId":400540247,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3712709762,"text":"うぅ…気になる…！正直、すっごく気になるぞ！","nextNodeIds":[400540248]},{"nodeId":400540248,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":4266558890,"text":"ふふっ、それなら妾について来るんじゃな。離島の会場へ行けば、目新しいものが見られるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[400540249]},{"nodeId":400540249,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":2285382730,"text":"それにあそこには、今回の任務について説明してくれる者もおる。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":400540242,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3800830786,"text":"真剣な顔で、またそんなデタラメを…","nextNodeIds":[400540243]},{"nodeId":400540225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":229084402,"text":"文化振興の会？","nextNodeIds":[400540226]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4005402,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1034"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4005403,"order":3,"stepDescription":"離島の容彩祭会場に行く","stepDescTextMapHash":1011304524,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4005403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q4005403_guide_WuGeXianGuangChang","10"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4005403,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q4005403_guide_WuGeXianGuangChang","10"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_G